## Backups

Scheduled Postgres dump on Iran is mandatory ops baseline (`scripts/backup-postgres.sh` via `/etc/cron.d/taranom-postgres-backup`). Do not claim production readiness without a recent listable dump on Iran.

## Historical docs

Dated reports under `docs/reports/` may still mention Hetzner as history. Operative rules, runbooks, CI defaults, and agent deploy steps must describe Iran only.
